{% comment %}
    Renders a regular in cart button

    Accepts:
    - product: {Object} The product object
    - block: {Object} The block object
    - float: {Boolean} Is the button floating
    Usage:
    {% render 'regular-in-cart-button', product: product %}
{% endcomment %}

<span class="regular-in-cart-button inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between {% if float %}mobile-mini:justify-center{% endif %} gap-2 pointer-events-none">
    <span class="cart-button-text pointer-events-none py-4 md:py-5 whitespace-nowrap">
        {% if block.settings.is_dynamic_variant %}
            {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title }}
        {% else %}
            {{ text | default: block.settings.text }}
        {% endif %}
    </span>
    <span class="main-price whitespace-nowrap {% if float %}mobile-mini:hidden{% endif %} inline">
        {%- liquid
            comment
                Prix d'appel (le moins cher) tant qu'aucune variante n'est demandee ;
                des que l'URL cible une variante (?variant=, liens profonds Pinterest /
                Shopping / e-mails), on affiche le prix reel de CETTE variante, sinon il
                contredit le selecteur qui, lui, la suit.
            endcomment
            assign price = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price
            if product.selected_variant == nil
                if template.suffix == 'painting' or template.suffix == 'personalized'
                    assign price = product.price_min
                endif
            endif
        -%}
        {{ price | money }}
    </span>
</span>